# Build configuration.
#
# The directory is ignored because it can hold machine-local settings
# (config/relay.json and anything a local run drops there), but the two
# files the BUILD ITSELF depends on are tracked:
#
#   config/default.json        the feature configuration (97 keys); every
#                               Phase 2 protection is gated on it, so a
#                               clone without it silently builds a
#                               different, weaker artifact
#   config/baseline_report.json  the security-gate baseline the
#                               regression checker compares against
#
# Neither contains a secret.  The tokens live in the OS keychain / the
# setup wizard, not here.
config/*
!config/default.json
!config/baseline_report.json
